Output assets/prompt-inbox-demo.gif
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 960
Set Height 420
Set Shell bash
Set Theme "Dracula"
Type "prompt-inbox setup --repo BartoszOsiej/externum"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "   ✓ Repo configured · GitHub Issues connected"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "# Send prompt → GitHub issue → agent handles it"
Enter
Sleep 800ms
